  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebbe3d2027f356bcb7877bb116ec4e0e9f132ef1b027d38df9bd08205965f30f.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **× and +**\n\n→ 12 + 6 × **9 ÷ 3** - 4 = 25\n\n→ 12 + **6 × 3** - 4 = 25\n\n→ **12 + 18** - 4 = 25\n\n→ 30 - 4 = 25\n\n→ 26 ≠ 25\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **+ and - **\n\n→ 12 × 6 - **9 ÷ 3** + 4 = 25\n\n→ **12 × 6** - 3 + 4 = 25\n\n→ **72** - 3 **+**** 4** = 25\n\n→ 76 - 3 = 25\n\n→ 73 ≠ 25\n\n→ **LHS ≠** **RHS**\n\n3) **÷ and -**\n\n→ 12 × 6 + 9 - **3 ÷ 4** = 25\n\n→ **12 × 6** + 9 - 3/4 = 25\n\n→ **72 + 9** - 3/4 = 25\n\n→ 81 - 3/4 = 25\n\n→ 80.25 ≠ 25\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **× and ÷**\n\n→ **12 ÷ 6** + 9 × 3 - 4 = 25\n\n→ 2 + **9 ****×**** 3** - 4 = 25\n\n→ 2 + 27 - 4 = 25\n\n→ 29 - 4 = 25\n\n→ 25 = 25\n\n→ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 4 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****× and ÷\"**.",
